## 6. EXAM TAKING SEQUENCE

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Browser
    participant ExamController
    participant ExamSession
    participant ExamJS
    participant API

    Student->>Browser: Clicks "Mulai Ujian"
    Browser->>ExamController: GET /student/exams/{id}/take
    ExamController->>ExamSession: Create session (in_progress)
    ExamController->>Browser: Render exam.php + take.php
    Browser->>ExamJS: Load exam.js, theme.js, design-system.css
    ExamJS->>ExamJS: Init timer, palette, navigation, auto-save
    
    loop Every 30s / on answer change
        ExamJS->>API: POST /api/exam/{id}/save (answers)
        API->>ExamSession: Update answers
    end
    
    alt Student clicks "Selesai"
        Student->>Browser: Click Submit
    else Timer reaches 0
        ExamJS->>Browser: Auto-submit
    end
    
    Browser->>API: POST /api/exam/{id}/submit
    API->>ExamSession: Status = submitted
    API->>API: Auto-grade MCQ/TF/FillBlank/Matching/Ordering
    API->>API: Queue Essay/Coding for manual grading
    API->>ExamSession: Calculate result, create results record
    API-->>Browser: Redirect to result page
    Browser->>Student: Show result
```

