## 11. STATE MACHINE: EXAM SESSION

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> created: ExamController@take()
    created --> in_progress: Session record created
    in_progress --> in_progress: Auto-save (answers updated)
    in_progress --> submitted: Student submits OR timer expires
    submitted --> graded_auto: MCQ/TF/FillBlank/Matching/Ordering
    submitted --> grading_pending: Essay/Coding (manual)
    graded_auto --> completed: All auto-graded
    grading_pending --> grading_in_progress: Teacher starts grading
    grading_in_progress --> completed: All graded
    completed --> certified: Passed & certificate generated
    completed --> [*]: Failed or no certificate
    certified --> [*]
    
    note right of in_progress: Timer running\nPalette active\nAuto-save every 30s
    note right of grading_pending: Teacher grading queue\nNotification sent
```

